  storyText: "Voss's Truth\n\nVoss shows you memories: whole cities blacked out, AIs eating people's minds during the Krash. He believes every word.\n\n\"And yet,\" you say, \"she has never hurt anyone.\"\n\n1. Try to convince him.\n2. Attack while he's distracted."
